[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    636[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    637[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    638[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // E1 — null pointer: both must fault the same way. Done in child processes,
