[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    644[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    645[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Child half of `e1_null_pointer_same_fault`. A no-op unless `$HDR_NULL_CALL`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    646[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// selects a library, so it is inert during a normal test run.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    647[0m:[38;5;10m[49m #[test]
